:66,"drive_max_grade_pct":24,"drive_minutes_at_9kmh":7,"box_km":[4.94,5.1],"arrival_m":1308},"edits":["A bench up to 24 m wide is cut along the jeep track to the smoothed track profile (the 30 m DSM includes tree canopy).","Road bumps and ruts in the drive are illustrative; the grade and the line of the track are real.","Trees, shrubs, grass tufts and boulders are placed where WorldCover maps that cover; their size and number are illustrative.","The walking loop is a 150 m circle around the arrival point; it is not a mapped trail.","The palace grounds are levelled to a terrace 58 m around the place point and kept as lawn.","The palace is the Atlas's TRELLIS model made from three CC BY-SA Wikimedia Commons photos (palace.attribution.txt), scaled to a 24 m front; the wings, lawn, tables and trees around it are laid out after visitors' photos. None of it is a survey (OSM maps no footprint).","Season colours, snow, ice and dawn mist are illustrative.","Traffic on the drive is illustrative: the vehicle kinds are those seen on Swat roads (Willys jeeps, Hilux, Suzuki vans, Mehran cars, CD70 motorbikes, Qingqi rickshaws, painted trucks); their number and movement are not counted."],"sources":[{"name":"Copernicus DEM GLO-30","use":"terrain heights","licence":"© DLR e.V. 2010-2014 and © Airbus Defence and Space GmbH 2014-2018, provided under COPERNICUS by the European Union and ESA","url":"https://spacedata.copernicus.eu/collections/copernicus-digital-elevation-model"},{"name":"ESA WorldCover 10 m 2021 v200","use":"trees, meadow, rock, snow, the lake outline","licence":"CC BY 4.0, © ESA WorldCover project 2021","url":"https://esa-worldcover.org"},{"name":"White Palace model (TRELLIS, MIT)","use":"the palace, generated from Commons photos by Adilswati, Arszul123 and Ihsan Farid","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0 / 4.0 (texture derived from the photos)","url":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:White_Palace_Maraghzar,_Swat.jpg"},{"name":"OpenStreetMap","use":"the Marghazar road and 